<Description>
<![CDATA[K5100 (2198-Exxxx-ERS) - Use the Motion Axis Fault Reset  instruction to clear the fault/warning in the drive]]>
</Description>
<RevisionNote>
<![CDATA[September 2019, initial release.]]>
</RevisionNote>
<AdditionalHelpText>
<![CDATA[============================================================
Instruction Overview:
-----
K5100 (2198-Exxxx-ERS) - Use the Motion Axis Fault Reset instruction to clear the fault/warning in the drive


Supplemental Descriptions:
-----
Sts_ERR codes:(Value - Description)
100 – Drive is not ready.
106 – Another MAFR is executing.


Revision Notes:
-----
1.1.01
- September 2019, initial release.


