<AddOnInstructionDefinition Name="AOI_ModuleReset" Class="Standard" Revision="1.0" RevisionExtension="JDR" ExecutePrescan="false" ExecutePostscan="false" ExecuteEnableInFalse="false" CreatedDate="2013-09-16T18:24:29.621Z" CreatedBy="Not Available" EditedDate="2020-03-26T17:00:00.615Z" EditedBy="WIN7-VM\Labuser"
 SoftwareRevision="v32.00">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Inhibits Module, Reset Module, Uninhibits Module]]>
</Description>
<RevisionNote>
<![CDATA[Developed for Safety I/O module reset with Signature/Lock]]>
</RevisionNote>
<AdditionalHelpText>
<![CDATA[Inhibits Module, Reset Module, Uninhibits Module
msg_Module_Reset can be shared by many modules, but must have Service Type = Device Reset
The MSG path is set from IO_ModRef inside the AOI.  
 ]]>
</AdditionalHelpText>
