<![CDATA[Aging Test Not Running]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[2]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Automatic Mode]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[4]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Wait For Trigger]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[6]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Check Signals]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[8]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Extend Z Axis]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[10]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Extend Probes]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[12]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Probes Extend Settle Delay]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[14]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Close VBat to Coil Relay]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[16]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Close VBat To Driver Board Relay]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[18]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Dwell Before High Current]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[20]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test High Current Test Start]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[30]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Turn Off 5V Test Signal]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[32]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Turn Off VBat Supply Relay]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[34]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Turn Off VBat Supply To Coil Relay & Retract Test Probes]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[35]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Probes Retract Settle Delay]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[36]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Retract Z Axis]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[48]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Retry Decision]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[50]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Cycle Complete]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[57]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Turn Off 5V Test Signal - Fault Recovery]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[58]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Turn Off VBat Supply Relay - Fault Recovery]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[59]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Turn Off VBat To Coil Relay - Fault Recovery]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[61]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Locked Out]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[62]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test 1 Cycle Stop]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[63]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Faulted]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".CONTROL.COUNTER[1]">
<![CDATA[Retry Counter]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".CONTROL.TIMER[0]">
<![CDATA[Wait For Load 1 Second Timer]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".CONTROL.TIMER[1]">
<![CDATA[Wait For Unload 1 Second Timer]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".CONTROL.TIMER[2]">
<![CDATA[Aging Test Timer]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".CONTROL.TIMER[3]">
<![CDATA[5V Off Delay Timer]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".CONTROL.TIMER[4]">
<![CDATA[14V Off Delay Timer]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".CONTROL.TIMER[5]">
<![CDATA[Arc Present Off Delay Timer]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".CONTROL.TIMER[6]">
<![CDATA[Check Inputs Delay Timer]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".CONTROL.TIMER[20]">
<![CDATA[Cycle Timer]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".CONTROL.OS[0]">
<![CDATA[Used ONS]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".CONTROL.BIT[0]">
<![CDATA[Test Running]]>
</Comment>
</Comments>
