</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[4]">
<![CDATA[Station 1 Escapement Wait For Part At End Of Conveyor]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[6]">
<![CDATA[Station 1 Escapement Control Extend Escapement]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand=".STATUS.STATE[8]">
