<Rung Number="29" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[If Safety Stop During Operation Then Load Fault Code]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIO(MainAssemblyOK) ,XIO(AgingOK) ]XIC(StationStatus[34].S13Attempt)XIO(StationStatus[34].S13Success)EQ(StationStatus[34].FailureType,0)EQ(A04Control_SM.Control.Timer[2].ACC,0)MOVE(140,StationStatus[34].FailureType);]]>
</Text>
