<![CDATA[Sensor Timers]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(MachineBasic.AlwaysOn)AOI_Debounce(AOI_A04_PartPresent_PE,A04_PartPresent_PE,50,50);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="31" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Test Running]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5])LIMIT(8,A04Control_SM.Control.StateReg,36)OTE(A04Control_SM.Control.Bit[0]);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="32" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Clear Tracking If Part Removed Manually From Machine]]>
