</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5]) XIC(A04Control_SM.Status.State[34]) XIC(A04Control_SM.Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[5].Active) XIO(FaultReset_PB) ]OTE(Alarm[5].Active);]]>
