</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Show Alarm popup when an alarm is present]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIO(NoMachineFaults) ,XIC(\S01Control.WarningActive) ,XIC(\r04BootLoad.WarningActive) ]ONS(OneShot.0)NE(\HMI.CurrentPopupNum,90)NE(\HMI.CurrentScreenNum,91)MOVE(90,\HMI.ReplaceScreenNum);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Close "Active Alarms" popup 90 or "All Active Alarms" screen 91 (If its showing) when there are no alarms present

Writing 9999 to \HMI.ReplaceScreenNum will close the pop up being displayed on the HMI
Writing 8888 to \HMI.ReplaceScreenNum will execute a NavBack command to return to previous screen on the HMI]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(NoMachineFaults)XIO(\S01Control.WarningActive)XIO(\r04BootLoad.WarningActive)TON(Tmr_DlyClose,?,?)XIC(Tmr_DlyClose.DN)ONS(OneShot.1)[EQ(\HMI.CurrentPopupNum,90) MOVE(9999,\HMI.ReplaceScreenNum) ,EQ(\HMI.CurrentScreenNum,91) MOVE(8888,\HMI.ReplaceScreenNum) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Alarm History Display]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(S:FS)[SIZE(History[0],0,HistSize) ,SIZE(HistoryDisplay[0],0,S_DispSize) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQ(\HMI.CurrentScreenNum,99)[ONS(OneShot.2) MOVE(0,DisplayListPointer) ,XIC(HistoryNav.PageUp) ONS(OneShot.3) [GE(DisplayListPointer,S_DispSize) CPT(DisplayListPointer,(DisplayListPointer+HistSize-S_DispSize-S_DispSize+1)MOD(HistSize-S_DispSize+1)) OTE(OneShot.8) ,XIO(OneShot.8) LT(DisplayListPointer,S_DispSize) MOVE(0,DisplayListPointer) ] ,XIC(HistoryNav.ScrollDown) ONS(OneShot.4) CPT(DisplayListPointer,(DisplayListPointer+1)MOD(HistSize-S_DispSize+1)) ,XIC(HistoryNav.ScrollUp) ONS(OneShot.6) CPT(DisplayListPointer,(DisplayListPointer+HistSize-S_DispSize)MOD(HistSize-S_DispSize+1)) ,XIC(HistoryNav.PageDown) ONS(OneShot.7) CPT(tempPtrCheck,HistSize-S_DispSize-S_DispSize) [LT(DisplayListPointer,tempPtrCheck) CPT(DisplayListPointer,(DisplayListPointer+S_DispSize)MOD(HistSize-S_DispSize+1)) OTE(OneShot.9) ,XIO(OneShot.9) GE(DisplayListPointer,tempPtrCheck) CPT(DisplayListPointer,HistSize-S_DispSize) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[LIMIT(0,DisplayListPointer,HistSize)CMP((HistSize - DisplayListPointer) > S_DispSize)COP(History[DisplayListPointer],HistoryDisplay[0],S_DispSize);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
