<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Supervisor State Machine

State 0: Safety Stop
State 1: First Scan
State 3: Manual Mode
State 4: Auto Initialize
State 5: Automatic Mode
State 6: Cycle Stop
State 7: Level 1 Fault Active]]>
