<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5]) XIC(r02AgingUnload_SM.Status.State[58]) ,XIC(r02AgingUnload_SM.Status.AutoPreOK) XIO(r02AgingUnload_IN.Running) ]XIO(r02AgingUnload_SM.Control.Bit[4])XIC(MachineBasic.Flash250msPD)OTE(r02AgingUnload_OUT.StartCmd);]]>
