<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5]) XIC(S02StepFeeder_SM.Status.State[4]) XIC(S02StepFeeder_SM.Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[0].Active) XIO(FaultReset_PB) ]OTE(Alarm[0].Active);]]>
