<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[3]) [XIC(HMI_Data.Control.Button[238]) ,XIC(S02_StepFeederEnable) XIO(HMI_Data.Control.Button[239]) ] ,XIC(HMI_Data.Status.MachineInSC) EQ(HMI_Data.Control.DINT_SP[0],2) ,XIC(MachineRunning) XIO(S02StepFeeder_SM.Status.State[61]) XIO(S02StepFeeder_SM.Status.State[62]) ]OTE(S02_StepFeederEnable);]]>
