</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For MPC Bushing ID Verify To Retract]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5]) [XIC(S03Control_SM.Status.State[18]) ,XIC(S03Control_SM.Status.State[40]) ] [XIO(S03_MPCBushingIDRet_PRX) ,XIC(S03_MPCBushingIDExt_PRX) ] XIC(S03Control_SM.Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[5].Active) XIO(FaultReset_PB) ]OTE(Alarm[5].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Surface Check To Extend
34 was 32]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5]) XIC(S03Control_SM.Status.State[12]) [EQ(MachinePartType,MachinePartTypeList[0]) GT(S03_MPCSurfaceCheck_IN,34) ,EQ(MachinePartType,MachinePartTypeList[1]) GT(S03_FoxSurfaceCheck_IN,34) ] XIC(S03Control_SM.Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[6].Active) XIO(FaultReset_PB) ]OTE(Alarm[6].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
