<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Press To Extend]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5]) XIC(S06Control_SM.Status.State[6]) XIC(S06Control_SM.Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[2].Active) XIO(FaultReset_PB) ]OTE(Alarm[2].Active);]]>
