<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Z Axis To Extend]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Supervisor_SM.Status.State[5]) [XIC(S27Control_SM.Status.State[14]) ,XIC(S27Control_SM.Status.State[32]) ] XIC(S27Control_SM.Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[5].Active) XIO(FaultReset_PB) ]OTE(Alarm[5].Active);]]>
